# Code of Conduct

This project follows the [Contributor Covenant](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/3/0/code_of_conduct/)
Code of Conduct, version 3.0.

Report unacceptable behaviour to **{{COC_CONTACT}}**. Reports are handled confidentially, and the
reporter is not required to interact with the person reported.

Enforcement follows the Covenant's enforcement ladder — a warning, then temporarily limited
activities, then temporary suspension, then a permanent ban — applied as a guideline rather than a
fixed tariff, with repair of harm as the goal at every tier.
